  {
   "id": "terror-of-hemasaurus-114809@major-2024-09-20",
   "gameId": "terror-of-hemasaurus-114809",
   "displayName": "UPDATE IS BACK ON!!!* - Join The Paingo Beta!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-09-20T08:05:27.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi Folks,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks to the overwhelming response from the community regarding the last announcement and video,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "THE UPDATE IS BACK ON!*",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The awesome folks at Kittehface Software (They did the console ports among other things), have generously offered to help make the update happen. *This update will focus on the new kaiju, called Paingo the pangolin, and will omit the planned new game mode. It is also going to fix some important bugs, especially on consoles, as well as integrate Cloud Saves. Its important that I keep this update streamlined and free of serious bugs, as I will probably only get one go at this.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Join the Paingo beta!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "I need your folks' help making sure this update is bug free to keep costs down as much as possible. Everybody who helps me test the game can get their name in the credits and make up a fake title like \"Billy Billerson, Unpaid and Exploited Intern\", subject to my approval. (There is a thread in the Paingo testing channel in which you can submit your name and fake title to appear in the credits): JOIN US ON DISCORD TO GET ACCESS TO THE BETA: Thank you to everyone who showed me and my game support in regards to the video posted in the last announcement.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
